                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyabazinga Nebukadinezzari ow'e Babilonia yaidha yaamulwanisa, era yaamala yaamusiba ku ndhegere, yaamutwala e Babilonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinezzari oyo yaatoola n'ebindi ku bintu ebyakozesebwanga mu isinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, yaabitwala yaabita mu kisaagaati kye eky'obwakyabazinga e Babilonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona ebigema ku kyabazinga Yehoiakimu, omuli ebyenhinhalwa bye yakola, n'ebindi bye baamuvuunaana, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyafaayo bya Bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli ni Buyudaaya. Mutabane we Yehoiakini yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
