            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia era yaadheemera ni kyabazinga Nebukadinezzari, eyali amaze okumulayiza mu Katonda, ng'ali n'okuwuliranga ebiragiro bya Nebukadinezzari oyo. Aye Zedekia oyo yaakola bwa mpwitu era yaakalangusa omwoyo gwe, yaaloba kwenenia kwira eri Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bakabona abakulu nga kw'otaire n'abakulembeze abantu, boona baakola ebibi einho nga bajiira ku byenhinhalwa byonabyona eby'abamaghanga agandi. Kale baayonoona batyo eisinzizo Musengwa Katonda mwene lye yatukuza mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda oyo, Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe yayongera okubagheerezanga abakwenda aghazira kukoogha naire, kuba yali ayenda okubawonia beene era n'okuwonia eisinzizo lye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye baayeeyereza abakwenda ba Katonda baanhooma bye yabakoba, era baasekerera abalanzi be, okutuusa lwe baaleetera Musengwa Katonda oyo okubasungughalira ekibitiriire, nga tibakaasobola kuwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
