                "loc": "JER.21.1+JER.21.2+JER.21.3+JER.21.4+JER.21.5+JER.21.6+JER.21.7+JER.21.8+JER.21.9+JER.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 21:1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.34.1+JER.34.2+JER.34.3+JER.34.4+JER.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho Musengwa Katonda yaaleeta kyabazinga w'e Babilonia okwidha okubalwanisa, yaitira abaana baibwe abaakaisuka ni mu isinzizo mwene, aghazira kusaasira muntu waire omulala k'abe mukulu oba muto, musaadha oba mukazi, mulamu oba mulwaire. Musengwa Katonda yaabaghaayo boonaboona mu ngalo edh'abazigu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoola n'ebintu byonabyona ebyakozesebwanga mu isinzizo ka bibe ebinene oba ebitono, n'eby'obukombe eby'omu isinzizo, n'eby'obukombe ebya kyabazinga, n'eby'abakungu be, byonabyona yaabitwala e Babilonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 9:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaayokya eisinzizo, yaamenhagho ekimante ekyali kyezungulula Yerusalemu, yaayokya amayumba gaamu goonagoona, era yaazikiriza n'ebintu byamu ebirungi byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoola abo abaawonagho mu lutalo, yaabatwala e Babilonia. Baabanga eyo nga bamugheereza era baamala baagheereza n'abaamwiririra ng'aviiregho, okutuusa obwakyabazinga obw'e Perusia bwe bwaidhagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 25:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekyo kyabaagho okutuukiriza Musengwa Katonda bye yayogera ng'abita mu Yeremia omulanzi, ati: “Ensi erirekebwa agho etyo okumala entangama ya myaka nsanvu ng'ewuumula, olw'okwesasuuza ekiwuumulo kya Sabbato kye baali tibakuzanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
